            "id": "levelled_description_5dc00b0ecf01",
            "level": {
              "value": 8
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "After your attack, you grab a bit of blood, cut hair, or other piece of the creature's body. You incorporate the material into a premade doll, paper figure, or other effigy to create a sympathetic link that makes it harder to resist your abilities. As long as you are Exploiting Vulnerability against that creature, it takes a –2 status penalty to its saving throws against thaumaturge abilities or items that use your thaumaturge class DC."
            }
          }
        }
      ]
